  triage:title "storage_and_nudge_router.rs's Steer path duplicates record_prompt_handoff's failure classification and discards the real AtmError" ;
  triage:description "rust-best-practices-agent (RBP-F002) and ruthless-boundary-qa (RBQA-F001) via BB6-QA-L2-1789268000 (PR #1461, feature/bb6-runtime-prompt-handoffs @ 0d2cc1142), verdict FAIL 0/3/2 (req-qa deliverable gate only, 0 blocking), 2026-09-13T00:42:20Z; same code region, one record. storage_and_nudge_router.rs's Steer path (lines ~493-519) has a second, call-site-owned failure-classification branch that discards the real task_store() error and duplicates record_prompt_handoff's own logic instead of routing through it. Independently verified by quality-mgr (own read confirms). Ruled genuine by fenix (PR #1461 comment, 2026-09-13T00:42:20Z)." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-bb" ;
